'''Mega Cat''' (メガにゃんこ, ''Mega Nyanko'') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.5 Update|Version 2.2.5]].

