==Enemy==
It has extremely long range (longer than [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] and even [[Asiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Assassinlan Pasalan]]) and deals very high damage. However, it has very low health and has slow attack rate and movement speed. Oddly enough, this enemy is [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]], probably to balance out its extremely low health.

==Strategy==
Due to its low health and massive damage and range, spawn non-stop fast attackers like [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and, after multiple attacks, the boss will die and you will win the battle. Alternatively, [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitters]] can be timed during its time between attacks in order to get some hits off. A good thing to note is that basically any [[Critical Hit]] from any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critter]] will kill it instantly, due to its low 99 HP.

